<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Demo Keamanan Web</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 min-h-screen">
  <header class="bg-white border-b border-gray-200 py-4 px-6 mb-6 flex items-center justify-between">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800">Demo Keamanan Web</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Halo, <%= username %> 👋 — <a href="/search" class="text-blue-600 underline">ke halaman search produk</a> · <a href="/komentar" class="text-blue-600 underline">ke halaman Komentar Produk (Bagian 2)</a></p>
    </div>
    <form method="POST" action="/logout">
      <button class="text-sm text-red-600 font-medium">Logout</button>
    </form>
  </header>

  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
    <% if (!vulnDemoEnabled) { %>
      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-300 text-yellow-800 text-sm rounded-lg px-4 py-3 mb-6">
        <strong>ℹ️ Demo Escape HTML, SQL Injection, dan XSS lagi DINONAKTIFIN.</strong>
        Set <code>ENABLE_VULN_DEMO=true</code> di <code>.env</code> terus restart server buat aktifin
        (cuma buat belajar di laptop lokal, jangan di server publik).
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <a href="/demo/validasi-server-side" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span class="text-2xl">✅</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-1 rounded-full bg-green-100 text-green-700">Selalu Aktif</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">1. Validasi Input Server-Side</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Coba submit data gak valid, liat gimana server nolaknya.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/demo/sanitasi" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span class="text-2xl">🧹</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-1 rounded-full bg-green-100 text-green-700">Selalu Aktif</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">2. Sanitasi Input</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Liat perbandingan input SEBELUM vs SESUDAH disanitasi.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/demo/escape-html" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span class="text-2xl">🔒</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-1 rounded-full <%= vulnDemoEnabled ? 'bg-red-100 text-red-700' : 'bg-gray-100 text-gray-500' %>">
            <%= vulnDemoEnabled ? 'Demo Aktif' : 'Dinonaktifin' %>
          </span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">3. Escape HTML</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Bandingin <code>&lt;%= %&gt;</code> vs <code>&lt;%- %&gt;</code> di EJS.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/demo/sql-injection" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span class="text-2xl">💉</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-1 rounded-full <%= vulnDemoEnabled ? 'bg-red-100 text-red-700' : 'bg-gray-100 text-gray-500' %>">
            <%= vulnDemoEnabled ? 'Demo Aktif' : 'Dinonaktifin' %>
          </span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">4. SQL Injection</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Bandingin query parameterized vs string SQL nyambung manual.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/demo/xss" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow sm:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span class="text-2xl">⚡</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-1 rounded-full <%= vulnDemoEnabled ? 'bg-red-100 text-red-700' : 'bg-gray-100 text-gray-500' %>">
            <%= vulnDemoEnabled ? 'Demo Aktif' : 'Dinonaktifin' %>
          </span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">5. XSS (Cross-Site Scripting)</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Coba masukin payload <code>&lt;script&gt;</code>, liat bedanya kena vs enggak.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
